# C3: the std submodules mlmf-stablehlo may name. Grows one commit at a time,
# each entry landing beside the code that forced it.
#
# `error` -- `impl std::error::Error for BytecodeError`.
# `fmt`   -- `impl std::fmt::Display for BytecodeError`.
# `ops`   -- `std::ops::Range`, the byte range of a section in the file.
# `str`   -- `std::str::from_utf8` on the producer string, spelled with the
#   `std::` prefix on purpose so the gate sees it.
error
fmt
ops
str
